<title>HONG KONG: BZW names Kenny head of SE Asian equity products.</title>
<headline>BZW names Kenny head of SE Asian equity products.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Asia Ltd said on Tuesday it had appointed Steve Kenny as head of Southeast Asian equity products, responsible for the development, sales and marketing of the company's equity products in the region.</p>
<p>Kenny relocated to Hong Kong from BZW Jakarta, where he was president and managing director in charge of equities.</p>
<p>BZW is a division of Barclays Bank Plc.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
